<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Searching</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;A strange twist of fate let Catra meet Adora, they grow up together and are inseperable since the day they met. But after Adora's grandmother dies and she loses her home in its aftermath, Adora decides to leave Half-Moon and search for her longlost mother, who, in Adora's eyes, is to blame for everything. Catra has a decision to make. Will she follow Adora, the girl that was more than just a friend for her, on her odyssey? What will they find? And will it be worth it?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-----------------------------------&lt;br /&gt;A Modern Day AU about a journey to an unknown country, a search for answers and the realization, that you should stay away from cults.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>axegb</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
